\pard\plain\itap0\s0\fi0\sb200\sa0\aspalpha\aspnum\adjustright\ltrpar\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\qj\faauto\sl260\slmult0\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0
\ulnone\cf2 Joost Klein is 'very happy and relieved' that the investigation into the alleged violent incident during the Eurovision Song Contest has been dropped, his manager told ANP. The singer was disqualified this year because he allegedly made a threatening movement toward a female employee. On Monday, the Public Prosecutor in Sweden announced that there was insufficient evidence.}
